  "axes": {
    "$type": "fontVariationSettings",
    "$description": "Fraunces' variable axes. SOFT rounds the serifs (0 sharp to 100 soft); WONK swaps in the leaning, quirky letters. The site's font files have these values built in (scripts/build-site-fonts.py reads them from here); the settings stay for the library's full-axes playground and as documentation.",
